WEBVTT

00:00:00.576 --> 00:00:02.110
Hello, salon owners!

00:00:02.188 --> 00:00:05.550
Someone walks past your door, or sits waiting at the counter.

00:00:05.959 --> 00:00:08.910
How can they book their next visit, just by holding up their phone?

00:00:09.416 --> 00:00:11.710
The answer is a poster with a QR code.

00:00:12.059 --> 00:00:15.790
In this lesson, I'll show you how to make your own Scan to book poster.

00:00:16.059 --> 00:00:19.070
It's completely free, and you don't need any design skills.

00:00:19.726 --> 00:00:24.430
First, open varaaai.com, scroll to the bottom of the page,

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:26.997
and tap QR booking poster maker.

00:00:27.343 --> 00:00:29.637
You can use it straight away, without signing in.

00:00:30.066 --> 00:00:32.117
On a phone, you'll see two buttons:

00:00:32.227 --> 00:00:33.477
Edit, and Preview.

00:00:34.143 --> 00:00:34.837
Step one:

00:00:35.076 --> 00:00:39.717
under Salon details, enter your Salon name, and upload your logo if you have one.

00:00:40.117 --> 00:00:40.997
Step two:

00:00:41.266 --> 00:00:43.025
under QR code and booking link,

00:00:42.975 --> 00:00:46.277
paste the link customers will open when they scan the code.

00:00:46.707 --> 00:00:49.877
Choose My own link for your website, Facebook or Instagram.

00:00:50.051 --> 00:00:53.557
Here, we've pasted the salon's VaraaAi booking page.

00:00:53.716 --> 00:00:56.410
And if you're signed in with your VaraaAi salon account,

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:58.677
your booking page link can be filled in for you.

00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:00.053
Step three:

00:01:00.212 --> 00:01:01.093
Poster text.

00:01:01.521 --> 00:01:02.533
Choose your languages:

00:01:02.722 --> 00:01:04.641
up to three can appear side by side,

00:01:04.591 --> 00:01:07.653
which is great if your customers come from many countries.

00:01:07.924 --> 00:01:11.893
Pick a ready-made Headline, like Scan to book, or Book here.

00:01:12.162 --> 00:01:14.373
Below that, you can add extra lines:

00:01:14.482 --> 00:01:19.173
an Offer, your Opening hours, your Phone number, or your Wi-Fi password.

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:20.617
Step four:

00:01:20.729 --> 00:01:21.417
Design.

00:01:21.837 --> 00:01:23.097
There are four styles:

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:26.457
Minimal, Luxury, Pastel, and Seasonal.

00:01:26.854 --> 00:01:30.217
Choose a Main color to match your salon, then choose the Format:

00:01:30.486 --> 00:01:35.907
A4 or A5 for the door, A6 for a table, a folded table tent, a round sticker,

00:01:35.857 --> 00:01:39.017
or the square and story sizes for Instagram.

00:01:39.626 --> 00:01:40.476
Last step:

00:01:40.653 --> 00:01:42.716
tap Preview to see the finished poster.

00:01:42.824 --> 00:01:43.356
Happy with it?

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:49.116
Tap Download PDF to print it, or Download PNG to post it on social media.

00:01:49.461 --> 00:01:52.836
Before you print lots of copies, scan the code once with your phone,

00:01:52.786 --> 00:01:55.036
to make sure it opens the right booking page.

00:01:55.645 --> 00:01:56.895
Where should you put your poster?

00:01:57.070 --> 00:01:59.793
On the glass door, at the till, on the nail desk,

00:01:59.743 --> 00:02:02.575
and on the mirror in front of the customer's chair.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:05.772
If the QR code goes to your VaraaAi booking page,

00:02:05.722 --> 00:02:09.535
your Overview page even counts the scans over the last thirty days.

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:11.135
Here's to lots more bookings!

00:02:11.154 --> 00:02:12.415
Now take the quiz below.
